sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Express and GraphQL
    participant R as Posts resolver
    participant L as Request user loader
    participant M as MongoDB
    C->>E: posts with first, after and author selection
    E->>E: Create request context and fresh loader
    E->>R: Resolve posts
    R->>R: Validate page size and decode cursor
    R->>M: Find by cursor, sort by _id, limit first + 1
    M-->>R: Bounded page documents
    R-->>E: Edges, pageInfo and author resolver functions
    E->>L: Load author IDs for returned posts
    L->>L: Deduplicate queued IDs
    L->>M: Find users with _id in requested IDs
    M-->>L: Matching users
    L->>L: Reorder to input keys, missing users become null
    L-->>E: Author values
    E-->>C: GraphQL data and any field errors


